									<p>Just before shutting off my computer and heading to bed I decided to give my email one last check and guess what I saw!!!<br /><br />Congratulations, your guild Awakened Fires has been approved!<br /><br />I quickly logged back in the the Guild Invite frenzy ensued. </p>
